  dialogue:
  - No, I have not... Where is he?
  - Well... Be careful! He is FORTUNATELY quite far east from here, but oh my...
    He looks...
  - Rather...
  - Ugly.
  - Why are you here anyway? Village is much safer...
  - I know but I needed to pick up some herbs for my tea.
  - Tea? We are in the middle of a weird-blue-mushroom invasion...
  - Darlin', someone needs to take care of the tea supply! It would be a much bigger
    disaster without it! So...
  - Boring...
  - Boring?
  - Psst... Did you know Master Vitalis once set his tail on fire when he tried to
    light a fireplace in the village? He has a baldspot on his tail!
  - Oops... I spilled it again.
  - . . .
